# problem-specific runtime parameters
# Jiang & Oh 2018, Section 4.2.2 (Fig 11): CR-modified shock from two colliding gas streams.
# rho=1, Pgas=1 uniform;  v=+FlowV (x<xc), -FlowV (x>xc);  Ec=Ec0 uniform;  Fc=(4/3) v Ec.
# Full two-moment CR: streaming (v_A=1) + diffusion (sigma'=10) + advection.  Vm=100.
# The paper runs three cases Ec0 = 1, 50, 200 (Pc = 1/3, 50/3, 200/3); set CR_Streaming_Ec0 per run.
CR_Streaming_Test        10             # 10 = Sec 4.2.2 colliding-flow CR-modified shock
CR_Streaming_Dir         0              # shock normal / streaming axis along x
CR_Streaming_FlowV       10.0           # collision half-speed |v| (paper: 10)
CR_Streaming_Ec0         1.0            # uniform CR energy density (paper: 1, 50, or 200)
CR_Streaming_FcInit      1              # initial CR flux: 1=advective (4/3)v*Ec (paper), 0=zero
